  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Fantom -- EVM-compatible DAG blockchain using Lachesis aBFT consensus for near-instant 1-second finality and near-zero fees. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens on Fantom Opera. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
